  "question": {
    "text": "The current <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></math> in an inductance coil varies with time according to the graph given in the figure.<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/ci/image12-02e5c8d4-0616-4230-b7dd-3aa521ccf23c.jpg\" style=\"height: 140px; width: 160px;\" /><br />\r<br />\rWhich one of the following graphs gives the variation of voltage with time across the inductor?",
    "image": null
  },
